# What ../../install.sh copies when someone installs this plugin without the plugin system.
# Verbs are documented in ../adversarial-review/install.manifest.

name   Greenlight
about  Merges the default branch into the current branch, pushes, and reruns the required integration check when the PR skipped it.

file   skills/greenlight/SKILL.md  skills/greenlight/SKILL.md       /greenlight

tip  /greenlight   merge the default branch in, push, make sure integration runs
